# Claude Code — local-only, never shared. Each of these is useful to keep on
# disk; none of it belongs to a forker. settings.local.json in particular is
# ignored globally on the author's machine, which would not protect a fork.
.mcp.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Orca — role prompts in .orca/ are committed and public-safe. Everything under
# local/ is machine-specific: env.md holds the Orca repo UUID and Run ID,
# human/ is the operator's gate briefs, state/ is the driver's journal and DAG.
.orca/local/
